                "Author Slaughtering Trophy"
              ],
              "children": null
            },
            {
              "key": "conversation",
              "values": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "key": "scene",
                  "values": [
                    "outfit/gold_trophy"
                  ],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "As you leave your ship at the spaceport, you see a courier ship land nearby at suicidal speed. Before the engines have even completely shut down, a man jumps out of the airlock and walks purposefully towards you.",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "\"Captain <last>, I have a package for you. Would you please sign here.\"",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "You have barely finished signing the last letter of your name when the courier pushes the package into your arms and hurries back to his ship. When you open the package, the first thing you see is a massive, golden trophy, which distracts you so much that you almost miss the enclosed letter. Who would send you something like this?",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "\"Dear Captain <last>, it was with great joy that I heard about your victories over the Author captains. Those scoundrels don't deserve any better. They never wanted to take me in! Just thinking about that evening in the bar on Starcross makes my blood boil. Well, the matter is now settled. Enclosed is a token of my appreciation. I wish you all the best. Kind regards, Captain Zuckung\"",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "Even though the sender of the package seems crazy to you, you decide to keep this wonderful trophy.",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "key": "decline",
                      "values": [],
                      "children": null
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
